{"id":"d139c8e88761c759","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation.md","title":"ZFC Prob Conditional Expectation","display":"df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation — ZFC Prob Conditional Expectation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation","58-df-zfc-prob2-conditional-expectation"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation — ZFC Prob Conditional Expectation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation</span><span>58-df-zfc-prob2-conditional-expectation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-conditional-expectation — ZFC Prob Conditional Expectation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P \\in V\">\\(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\">\\(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S\\)</span> are the measure-domain, carrier, and representative-level integrability terms defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ConditionalExpectation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ConditionalExpectation}_S\\)</span> are the four-place predicates defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}measure\\text{-}data}\\vdash\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb P)\\quad\\land\\quad\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}measure\\text{-}data}\\vdash\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb P)\\quad\\land\\quad\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real}\\vdash\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\int_\\Omega|f|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real}\\vdash\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\int_\\Omega|f|\\,d\\mathbb P&lt;\\infty\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})=1\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(Y,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(Y;(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal G),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\left(\\int_A Y\\,d\\mathbb P=\\int_A X\\,d\\mathbb P\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})=1\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(Y,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(Y;(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal G),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\left(\\int_A Y\\,d\\mathbb P=\\int_A X\\,d\\mathbb P\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2ConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2ConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate is representative-level: two versions equal almost everywhere both satisfy it, while no quotient element is incorrectly treated as a pointwise function.</li>\n<li>Conditional expectation is relative to the explicit sub-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal G\\)</span> and is characterized by its integral identities.</li>\n<li>prob2 名称是同一谓词的兼容别名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb2ConditionalExpectation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}measure\\text{-}data}\\vdash\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathbb P)\\quad\\land\\quad\\Omega_{\\mathbb P}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}real}\\vdash\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in\\mathbb R^\\Omega\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\Omega,\\mathcal F),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\int_\\Omega|f|\\,d\\mathbb P<\\infty","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mathbb P,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathbb P(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})=1\\land\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal G,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P}\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(X,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{IntegrableReal}_S(Y,\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\Sigma_{\\mathbb P},\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(Y;(\\Omega_{\\mathbb P},\\mathcal G),(\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\left(\\int_A Y\\,d\\mathbb P=\\int_A X\\,d\\mathbb P\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob2\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}expectation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb2ConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpectation}_S(Y,X,\\mathcal G,\\mathbb P)","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G","display":false}],"bytes":2926,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c90bb6129c5e559","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"44dfeb13a23ac5e0","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcProbConditionalExpecta